                  "// courses_required is the GLOBAL catalog count (every course ever created with",
                  "// required exams) — there's no DELETE /api/courses, so it only grows across repeated",
                  "// runs. Assert >= 1 rather than an exact match so the collection stays repeatable.",
                  "pm.test(\"diploma progress reflects the completed course\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.diploma_progress.courses_completed).to.eql(1);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.diploma_progress.courses_required).to.be.at.least(1);",
                  "});"
