    {
      "name": "4. Reference — Manual Only (410 expired attempt)",
      "description": "Not part of an automated run. The attempt window is a real 10 minutes server-side (see ExamService.ExamAttempts @attempt_duration_seconds), so triggering a genuine 410 needs a real wait — there's no API to shorten it. The ExUnit suite covers this exact case deterministically (by inserting a pre-expired attempt directly into the DB), so this request exists purely for manual/exploratory testing.\n\nTo use it: run folder 1 once to get a course_id, start a fresh attempt via folder 2's \"Start Attempt\" request, copy its attempt_id into the `expired_attempt_id` collection variable, wait 10 minutes without finalizing it, then run this request.",
